          "expr": "sum by (provider) (rate(bluebird_openmeteo_weight_spent_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Open-Meteo's own billing unit: one location in a batch is one call. The dashed line is the per-service pacer budget (UPSTREAM_WEIGHT_PER_MINUTE_*, default 550); spend holds under it by pacing, so touching the line means batches are sleeping, not failing."
